{"seq":1,"slug":"price-list-types-and-price-elements","title":"价目表类型与价格要素","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-channel-price-list-administration/price-list-masterdata/price-list-types-and-price-elements","wordCount":3550,"readingTime":15,"html":"<h1 id=\"价目表类型与价格要素\">价目表类型与价格要素</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>跨境团队第一次尝试「把价格做成主数据」时，最常见的失败不是算法不会写，而是把三个不同层级的东西塞进了同一个字段。价目表本身（Price List）是一个<strong>带生效期的版本化主数据对象</strong>，它下面挂着若干<strong>价格要素（price element）</strong>，而每个要素又由**价格类型（price type）**决定它在计算链里的位置。三者混淆，就会出现「改了价格却没生效」「同一张表在不同渠道算出不同结果」这类无法复现的故障。</p>\n<p>价目表的数据模型可以拆成头（header）与行（item）两层。头层承载<strong>作用域</strong>——币种、价格单位、销售组织、分销渠道、客户组、生效期；行层承载<strong>内容</strong>——商品与价格要素。作用域决定了这张表「对谁、在哪个渠道、用哪种货币」成立，内容决定了它「算出来是多少」。判定一张价目表是否命中某个报价场景，本质上是拿场景的维度去匹配表的头层作用域。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    PL[价目表 Price List] --&gt; H[头: 作用域]&#10;    PL --&gt; I[行: 商品 + 价格要素]&#10;    H --&gt; H1[币种 / 价格单位]&#10;    H --&gt; H2[销售组织 / 分销渠道]&#10;    H --&gt; H3[客户组 / 地区]&#10;    H --&gt; H4[生效期 from - to]&#10;    I --&gt; E1[基础价 Base / List Price]&#10;    I --&gt; E2[折扣与加价 Discount / Surcharge]&#10;    I --&gt; E3[税额 Tax]&#10;    I --&gt; E4[运费/关税 Freight / Duty]&#10;    E1 --&gt; R[最终成交价 Net Price]&#10;    E2 --&gt; R&#10;    E3 --&gt; R&#10;    E4 --&gt; R\">graph TD\n    PL[价目表 Price List] --&gt; H[头: 作用域]\n    PL --&gt; I[行: 商品 + 价格要素]\n    H --&gt; H1[币种 / 价格单位]\n    H --&gt; H2[销售组织 / 分销渠道]\n    H --&gt; H3[客户组 / 地区]\n    H --&gt; H4[生效期 from - to]\n    I --&gt; E1[基础价 Base / List Price]\n    I --&gt; E2[折扣与加价 Discount / Surcharge]\n    I --&gt; E3[税额 Tax]\n    I --&gt; E4[运费/关税 Freight / Duty]\n    E1 --&gt; R[最终成交价 Net Price]\n    E2 --&gt; R\n    E3 --&gt; R\n    E4 --&gt; R</pre><p>理解这张图的关键：<strong>头层决定「谁适用」，行层决定「多少钱」，价格要素决定「怎么算到那个钱」</strong>。把作用域写成文本备注而不是结构化维度，是绝大多数价格主数据事故的起点——系统再也无法自动判断一张表是否该被某个渠道采用。</p>\n<p>几类最容易混淆的价目表口径，先建立对照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>英文 / 缩写</th>\n<th>数值含义</th>\n<th>常见误用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标价 / 牌价</td>\n<td>List Price</td>\n<td>未折扣的标准对外价</td>\n<td>被当作成交价直接下单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>净价</td>\n<td>Net Price</td>\n<td>折扣后、税前应付价</td>\n<td>与含税价混填同一字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>建议零售价</td>\n<td>MSRP / RRP</td>\n<td>品牌建议的终端零售价</td>\n<td>被当作对经销商的供货价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最低广告价</td>\n<td>MAP</td>\n<td>对外广告展示价下限</td>\n<td>被误解为可强制成交价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批发 / 贸易价</td>\n<td>Wholesale / Trade</td>\n<td>对渠道的供货价</td>\n<td>与促销价叠加导致穿价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本加成价</td>\n<td>Cost-Plus</td>\n<td>成本加固定加成</td>\n<td>加成口径未区分含税成本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表本身就在说明：价格类型不是同义词的罗列，而是<strong>同一商品在不同商务关系下的不同法律与财务口径</strong>。把 MAP 当成交价、把 MSRP 当供货价，会让下游整条渠道链路的价格全部错位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"价目表的类型学\">价目表的类型学</h2><p>价格主数据的第一层设计，是回答「按什么维度切分价目表」。维度选错，后续的维护成本会随商品数与渠道数的乘积爆炸。主流实践把价目表按四个正交维度分类。</p>\n<p><strong>第一维度是币种与地区。</strong> 一张表通常只承载单一币种，多地区销售时要么按地区各建一张，要么以基准币种加持汇率转换。用 ISO 4217 三字母代码（如 CNY、USD、EUR）而非符号，是全球价格主数据不可省略的约定——<code>$</code> 在美元、澳元、加元、港币之间歧义，一旦落库就无法机器判读。</p>\n<p><strong>第二维度是渠道。</strong> 自营站、平台旗舰店、经销商、B2B 批发，各自的价目表通常相互独立。渠道维度常与「分销渠道（Distribution Channel）」和「客户组（Customer Group）」组合，构成作用域三元组。</p>\n<p><strong>第三维度是客户层级。</strong> 对 B2B 而言，同一渠道内不同客户的协议价可能不同，需按客户或客户组挂载专属价格记录，覆盖通用表。</p>\n<p><strong>第四维度是版本与生效期。</strong> 价格不是标量而是<strong>带时间的区间</strong>。任何一张价目表都必须有 <code>valid_from</code> 与 <code>valid_to</code>，缺失生效期的价格在系统里等于一次性的临时值。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>作用域粒度</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n<th>维护成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基础价目表</td>\n<td>渠道 + 币种</td>\n<td>全渠道基准价</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渠道价目表</td>\n<td>渠道 + 客户组 + 币种</td>\n<td>平台 vs 经销差异化</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户专属价目表</td>\n<td>单客户</td>\n<td>协议价 / 大客户</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>促销价目表</td>\n<td>渠道 + 时段</td>\n<td>活动价 / 秒杀</td>\n<td>高，时效敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本加成价目表</td>\n<td>供应商 + 币种</td>\n<td>内部结算 / 转定价</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阶梯价目表</td>\n<td>渠道 + 数量区间</td>\n<td>批量折扣</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个常见的规模陷阱：若把「渠道 × 客户组 × 币种」各自建独立表，表数量会随维度笛卡尔积增长。更稳的做法是<strong>一张表 + 多维作用域字段</strong>，让系统在报价时做维度匹配，而不是让人预先枚举所有组合。这也是条件技术（condition technique）在现代价格引擎里取代「手工建表」的根本原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"价格要素的构成与计算顺序\">价格要素的构成与计算顺序</h2><p>价格要素是价目表行里真正承载金额的部分。它的难点不在单个要素，而在<strong>多个要素按何种顺序作用于单价</strong>。同一个 10% 折扣，作用在税前还是税后、作用在折前还是折后，结果可以差出两位数的百分点。</p>\n<p>主流价格引擎（以 SAP 的条件技术为代表，见 SAP Help Portal 的 Pricing 与 Condition Technique 文档）把计算拆成三件套：**条件类型（condition type）**定义一类价格要素，**访问顺序（access sequence）**定义到哪几个条件表里依次找值，**计算方案（calculation schema / pricing procedure）**定义这些要素的先后与正负。这实际上是把「价格怎么算」从代码里抽出来变成可配置的元数据。</p>\n<p>计算链从基础价出发，逐层施加折扣、加价、费用、税：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{net} = \\Big( P_{base} \\cdot \\prod_{k=1}^{n}(1 - d_k) + \\sum_{j=1}^{m} S_j \\Big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9535em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0652em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{base}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是基础价，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个折扣率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是加价或附加费（运费、处理费、最低起订附加）。含税价再乘税率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{gross} = P_{net} \\cdot (1 + \\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oss</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 是适用税率。这里最容易被忽略的是<strong>价格单位（price unit）</strong>：基础价极少是「每 1 件」，更常见是「每 100 件」「每 1000 件」。若价格单位不跟着价格要素一起存储，报价时就会出现「单价 12.5」到底是 12.5 元/件还是 12.5 元/百件的歧义，且这种错误在小批量测试中不会暴露，只在大批量下单时一次性放大。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[取基础价&lt;br/&gt;按价格单位归一] --&gt; B{有协议价/条件记录?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[用条件记录覆盖基础价]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[用价目表基础价]&#10;    C --&gt; E[按折扣序列逐个施加]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F{达到数量阶梯?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[叠加阶梯折扣]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[跳过阶梯]&#10;    G --&gt; I[加运费/关税/处理费]&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J[按舍入规则取整]&#10;    J --&gt; K{含税展示市场?}&#10;    K --&gt;|是| L[乘 1+税率 得含税价]&#10;    K --&gt;|否| M[保持税前价 + 单列税额]\">flowchart TD\n    A[取基础价&lt;br/&gt;按价格单位归一] --&gt; B{有协议价/条件记录?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[用条件记录覆盖基础价]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[用价目表基础价]\n    C --&gt; E[按折扣序列逐个施加]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F{达到数量阶梯?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[叠加阶梯折扣]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[跳过阶梯]\n    G --&gt; I[加运费/关税/处理费]\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J[按舍入规则取整]\n    J --&gt; K{含税展示市场?}\n    K --&gt;|是| L[乘 1+税率 得含税价]\n    K --&gt;|否| M[保持税前价 + 单列税额]</pre><p>阶梯定价还有一层语义分叉必须显式建模：**graduated（分级累进）**是「前 N 件按 A 价、超出部分按 B 价」，<strong>to-scale（全量适用）<strong>是「达到 N 件后</strong>全部</strong>按 B 价」。两者在同样数量下总额不同，多数商业场景用 to-scale，但供应链结算场景常需 graduated。把两者混为一谈的价目表，会在对账时产生系统性偏差。</p>\n<p>各类价格要素的定位，可以用一张表固定下来：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>价格要素</th>\n<th>作用方向</th>\n<th>计税基础</th>\n<th>是否随数量变化</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基础价</td>\n<td>起始</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>常随阶梯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渠道折扣</td>\n<td>减</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数量阶梯折扣</td>\n<td>减</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>促销折让</td>\n<td>减</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否，时段敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运费附加</td>\n<td>加</td>\n<td>视 Incoterms</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关税</td>\n<td>加</td>\n<td>是（DDP 下）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>处理/包装费</td>\n<td>加</td>\n<td>视法域</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增值税</td>\n<td>加</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>运费与关税是否计入价目表，取决于贸易术语。按 ICC《Incoterms 2020》，DDP（Delivered Duty Paid）下卖方承担进口关税，价格里必须含税含费；DAP（Delivered at Place）下关税由买方承担，价目表就只到「送达地未完税」。同一批货用 DAP 报价却在结算时忘了补关税，是跨境订单毛利穿仓的经典成因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多币种-税制与舍入-价格要素的地区差异\">多币种、税制与舍入：价格要素的地区差异</h2><p>一套价格主数据要走出国门，就必须把「币种、税制、舍入」三项地区性规则做成可配置项，而不是散落在代码分支里。</p>\n<p><strong>币种与汇率。</strong> 价格要素以单一币种存储，跨币种报价靠汇率换算。汇率本身有<strong>汇率类型</strong>之分：即期汇率、历史汇率、预算汇率，用于不同财务口径。欧元区广泛采用欧洲央行（ECB）每日约 16:00 CET 发布的欧元参考汇率作为基准，其余币种以对欧元的中间价交叉换算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>U</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>U</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{tgt} = P_{src} \\cdot \\frac{R_{tgt/EUR}}{R_{src/EUR}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">sr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4697em;vertical-align:-1.0412em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4285em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">sr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7452em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0412em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>式中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>U</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{x/EUR}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0385em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是币种 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 兑欧元的参考汇率。换算时还必须带<strong>汇率生效日</strong>——用错日的汇率在剧烈波动期会造成可观偏差，跨境价格系统通常把汇率快照与报价单一并存档以保证可复算。</p>\n<p><strong>税制。</strong> 影响价目表结构的是「含税展示 vs 税前展示」。欧盟依《增值税指令》2006/112/EC，对消费者展示价格时通常必须为<strong>含增值税价</strong>；美国则普遍为<strong>税前价 + 结算时按州与地方税率加征销售税</strong>；日本消费税标准税率 10%，印度 GST 分档（5%/12%/18%/28%）。这意味着同一张价目表在不同市场的<strong>展示语义不同</strong>，把含税与税前价填进同一字段会让价格比较、毛利核算、税率校验全部失效。</p>\n<p><strong>舍入。</strong> 舍入不只是四舍五入。瑞士市场普遍把现金价舍入到 0.05 的整数倍；瑞典历史上有 öresavrundning；心理定价则要求价签落在 x.99 或 x.90。舍入规则应作为价目表的<strong>属性</strong>存储：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>P</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">round</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>P</mi><mi>δ</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P&#x27; = \\operatorname{round}\\!\\left(\\frac{P}{\\delta}\\right) \\cdot \\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">round</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 是舍入步长（如 0.05、0.01、1）。舍入发生的<strong>位置</strong>同样关键：应在计算链末端对最终价舍入一次，而非每个要素各自舍入——逐要素舍入会把误差累加成系统性偏差。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>市场</th>\n<th>币种</th>\n<th>展示口径</th>\n<th>典型舍入</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>德国</td>\n<td>EUR</td>\n<td>含税</td>\n<td>0.01</td>\n<td>VAT 19%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>英国</td>\n<td>GBP</td>\n<td>含税</td>\n<td>0.01</td>\n<td>VAT 20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>美国</td>\n<td>USD</td>\n<td>税前</td>\n<td>0.01</td>\n<td>州+地方销售税</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日本</td>\n<td>JPY</td>\n<td>含税</td>\n<td>1（无小数）</td>\n<td>消费税 10%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>瑞士</td>\n<td>CHF</td>\n<td>含税</td>\n<td>0.05</td>\n<td>现金舍入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>印度</td>\n<td>INR</td>\n<td>含税</td>\n<td>0.01</td>\n<td>GST 分档</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的价值不在数字本身，而在它揭示了<strong>价格主数据的地区字段不能是「币种」一个</strong>：展示口径、舍入步长、税率档位必须与币种并列成为地区画像。把日本价目表按 0.01 舍入，会直接产出系统无法结算的带小数日元金额。</p>\n<h2 id=\"渠道作用域与价格要素的确定逻辑\">渠道作用域与价格要素的确定逻辑</h2><p>价目表本身不决定报价——决定报价的是<strong>价格确定（price determination）</strong>：给定「客户 + 商品 + 渠道 + 数量 + 时间」，系统到哪张表、找哪个要素、取哪个值。这一步是把作用域从静态标签变成动态查询的过程。</p>\n<p>确定逻辑通常按「从专用到通用」的访问顺序逐级下降。以典型的条件记录为例：系统先找「客户 + 商品」的专属记录，命中则停；未命中退到「客户组 + 商品」；再退到「渠道 + 商品」；最后落到「商品」的通用价目表。<strong>先命中先返回</strong>，因此专用记录天然覆盖通用记录。这与 DNS 解析、路由最长前缀匹配是同一种结构。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Q[报价请求&lt;br/&gt;客户+商品+渠道+数量+日期] --&gt; A1{客户+商品 专属记录?}&#10;    A1 --&gt;|命中| R[返回该价格要素]&#10;    A1 --&gt;|未命中| A2{客户组+商品?}&#10;    A2 --&gt;|命中| R&#10;    A2 --&gt;|未命中| A3{渠道+商品?}&#10;    A3 --&gt;|命中| R&#10;    A3 --&gt;|未命中| A4{商品通用价目表?}&#10;    A4 --&gt;|命中| R&#10;    A4 --&gt;|未命中| ERR[无有效价格&lt;br/&gt;阻断下单]\">graph TD\n    Q[报价请求&lt;br/&gt;客户+商品+渠道+数量+日期] --&gt; A1{客户+商品 专属记录?}\n    A1 --&gt;|命中| R[返回该价格要素]\n    A1 --&gt;|未命中| A2{客户组+商品?}\n    A2 --&gt;|命中| R\n    A2 --&gt;|未命中| A3{渠道+商品?}\n    A3 --&gt;|命中| R\n    A3 --&gt;|未命中| A4{商品通用价目表?}\n    A4 --&gt;|命中| R\n    A4 --&gt;|未命中| ERR[无有效价格&lt;br/&gt;阻断下单]</pre><p><strong>日期过滤在每一级都要先做。</strong> 每条记录自带生效期，访问顺序里日期是硬过滤条件而非匹配维度之一。一件最常见的生产故障是「未来生效的促销价被提前命中」：如果查询只用 <code>valid_from &lt;= today</code> 而漏了 <code>valid_to &gt;= today</code>，尚未开始或已过期的记录都会被误用。正确条件是区间包含：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t \\in [\\,valid\\_from,\\ valid\\_to\\,]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6542em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>把日期与作用域一并写进条件表的主键约束，可以从结构上杜绝这类错误。</p>\n<p>作用域维度本身也需要治理。渠道不是扁平列表——自营、平台、经销、批发之间常有父子层级，价格既可在叶子渠道定义，也可从父渠道继承。可继承的作用域要求系统明确<strong>继承与覆盖的优先级</strong>：子级定义覆盖父级，父级提供兜底。若层级关系只存在于人脑或运营表里，价格继承就会变成不可预测的隐式行为。</p>\n<p>最后是<strong>币种一致性</strong>校验。报价币种必须与所选价目表的币种一致，或经由显式汇率换算并记录汇率快照。缺省地拿一个币种的价格当另一个币种用——例如把 USD 价目表直接用于 EUR 渠道——是最隐蔽也最昂贵的一类价格主数据缺陷，因为它在测试中数值总是「看起来合理」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>价目表是<strong>带生效期的主数据对象</strong>，分头层（作用域：币种/渠道/客户组/生效期）与行层（商品 + 价格要素）。</li>\n<li>价格要素按<strong>确定顺序</strong>作用于单价：基础价 → 折扣 → 加价/费用 → 舍入 → 税；顺序错、舍入位置错都会产生系统性偏差。</li>\n<li><strong>价格单位</strong>（每 1/100/1000 件）与价格要素同等重要，漏存会在大批量场景下放大错误。</li>\n<li>阶梯定价需区分 <strong>graduated（累进）</strong> 与 <strong>to-scale（全量）</strong>，两者总额不同，不可互换。</li>\n<li>多地区价目表必须把<strong>展示口径（含税/税前）、舍入步长、税率档位</strong>与币种并列建模；日元无小数、瑞郎 0.05 舍入是必须显式处理的地区规则。</li>\n<li>价格确定用<strong>从专用到通用</strong>的访问顺序，先命中先返回；日期是每一级的硬过滤条件，区间包含而非单边比较。</li>\n<li>运费与关税是否入表由 <strong>Incoterms 2020</strong>（DDP 含税含费 / DAP 未完税）决定，口径不一致会直接穿仓毛利。</li>\n<li>作用域层级（渠道父子的继承与覆盖）与币种一致性校验，是价格主数据从「能算」走向「算得可复现」的两道必经关。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"价目表类型与价格要素","id":"价目表类型与价格要素"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"价目表的类型学","id":"价目表的类型学"},{"level":2,"text":"价格要素的构成与计算顺序","id":"价格要素的构成与计算顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"多币种、税制与舍入：价格要素的地区差异","id":"多币种-税制与舍入-价格要素的地区差异"},{"level":2,"text":"渠道作用域与价格要素的确定逻辑","id":"渠道作用域与价格要素的确定逻辑"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"多币种与计量单位价格换算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-channel-price-list-administration/price-list-masterdata/multi-currency-and-uom-price-conversion"}}